{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_104_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，戊申，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月，壬午，公子遂會晉趙盾盟於衡雍。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"五、乙酉，公子遂會雒戎盟於暴。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"六、公孫敖如京師，不至而復。丙戌，奔莒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"不言所至，未如也。未如則未復也。未如而曰如，不廢君命也。未復而曰復，不專君命也。其如非如也，其復非復也，唯奔莒之為信，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"七、螽。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"八、宋人殺其大夫司馬，宋司城來奔。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_104_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_104","textTraditional":"司馬，官也。其以官稱，無君之辭也。司城，官也。其以官稱，無君之辭也。來奔者不言出，舉其接我也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}